{
  "format_version": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "This file does NOT belong in a shared project. Copy it to your own",
    "environment -- by default ~/.config/precedent/config.json, or",
    "wherever $PRECEDENT_USER_CONFIG points -- so it names your personal",
    "set, which nobody else can read.",
    "A shared project declares only universal and team sources, in its own",
    "tracked precedent.json; the tools refuse a personal set declared there.",
    "",
    "`repo_url` is what the session-start hook clones your set FROM. It",
    "lives here, in this private per-machine file, and not in any shared",
    "project's tracked hook -- a URL committed there would publish the",
    "existence and location of a private repository to everyone who can",
    "read that project. Set it on EVERY machine you work from: without it",
    "the hook cannot fetch your set, says so, and the session runs with",
    "your team and universal practices only.",
    "tools/precedent_bootstrap_source.py writes all three fields for you",
    "when it creates the set; this sample is for filling one in by hand."
  ],
  "individual": {
    "name": "{{NAME}}",
    "path": "{{DEST_PATH}}",
    "repo_url": "{{SOURCE_REPO_URL}}"
  }
}
